                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Mibibli's Quest really highlights the creative freedom that comes with being \"crappy\"\nBy bucking traditional convention constantly it creates gameplay scenarios so unlike anything I've ever seen in a platformer, playing through it for the first time was an absolute joy just to see what new bullshit would happen to me next and it rarely disappointed. If I were to be a huge loser about it I'd compare it favorably to Cruelty Squad or the works of thecatamites (Space Funeral, Anthology of the Killer) so if you're a fan of those you owe it to yourself to check it out.",
